VisitorPolicy
The square is open year‑round from 08:00 to 20:00, with possible extensions during peak season or for the nightly light‑and‑fountain show. Admission for foreign visitors costs approximately 50,000–60,000 UZS, subject to seasonal changes. It may close temporarily for state events or official visits. For inquiries, call the Samarkand Tourism Information Center at +998 66 235 38 22 or visit the ticket office at the main entrance. No dedicated official website exists, but information is available through the Uzbekistan Tourism Portal.
